---
import HeroIcon from '../hero/HeroIcon.astro';
import '../../styles/about-content.css';
---
<div class="about-layout about-profile">
  <div class="about-profile-identity">
    <img class="about-portrait" src="/assets/profile/sandy-rahmansyah.webp" alt="Portrait of Sandy Rahmansyah" width="640" height="640" />
    <div class="about-identity-details">
      <h3>Sandy Rahmansyah</h3>
      <p class="about-role">Frontend Developer</p>
      <p class="about-place"><HeroIcon name="map" /><span>Samarinda, Indonesia</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="content-lead">Thoughtful interfaces, built with care.</p>
  <p>I build customer-facing web applications, dashboards, and content management systems, taking frontend implementation from requirements through release.</p>
  <dl class="about-profile-facts"><div><dt>Frontend experience</dt><dd>6+ years, as stated in the CV</dd></div><div><dt>Core stack</dt><dd>Vue · Nuxt · React · Next.js</dd></div></dl>
  <div class="content-block about-education">
    <h3>Education</h3>
    <ol class="education-timeline">
      <li>
        <p class="education-date">2023–Present <span>· as stated in the supplied CV</span></p>
        <h4>Information Systems</h4>
        <p class="education-school">Universitas Terbuka</p>
        <p>Coursework in programming, databases, networking, and information systems. Degree in progress.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="education-date">October–November 2019</p>
        <h4>Full Stack Development</h4>
        <p class="education-school">Arkademy <span>· now Pijar Camp</span></p>
        <p>Intensive training in React Native and Express.js mobile application development.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <a class="content-cv" href="/downloads/Sandy_Rahmansyah_CV.pdf" download="Sandy_Rahmansyah_CV.pdf">Download CV<HeroIcon name="download" /></a>
</div>
